uto":"汉","start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"950c8eb1-db0e-11ef-a5f1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"天竺","place_name_jianti_auto":"天竺","start_index":136,"tongjian_id":"950c8eb2-db0e-11ef-932b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"梵","place_name_jianti_auto":"梵","start_index":187,"tongjian_id":"950c8eb3-db0e-11ef-9e26-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":198,"tongjian_id":"950c8eb4-db0e-11ef-a8c3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":203,"tongjian_id":"950c8eb5-db0e-11ef-ab95-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","start_index":226,"tongjian_id":"950c8eb6-db0e-11ef-9f8f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"甘泉宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"甘泉宫","start_index":243,"tongjian_id":"950c8eb7-db0e-11ef-a5db-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"大夏","place_name_jianti_auto":"大夏","start_index":272,"tongjian_id":"950c8eb8-db0e-11ef-a0dd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"身毒國","place_name_jianti_auto":"身毒国","start_index":279,"tongjian_id":"950c8eb9-db0e-11ef-811d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"天竺","place_name_jianti_auto":"天竺","start_index":285,"tongjian_id":"950c8eba-db0e-11ef-9e65-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"大月氏","place_name_jianti_auto":"大月氏","start_index":311,"tongjian_id":"950c8ebb-db0e-11ef-8a5d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"天竺","place_name_jianti_auto":"天竺","start_index":372,"tongjian_id":"950c8ebc-db0e-11ef-8a1a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"洛陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"洛阳","start_index":394,"tongjian_id":"950c8ebd-db0e-11ef-9edf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":422,"tongjian_id":"950c8ebe-db0e-11ef-9b0c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"白馬寺","place_name_jianti_auto":"白马寺","start_index":425,"tongjian_id":"950c8ebf-db0e-11ef-91e7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"洛城","place_name_jianti_auto":"洛城","start_index":429,"tongjian_id":"950c8ec0-db0e-11ef-a126-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雍關","place_name_jianti_auto":"雍关","start_index":431,"tongjian_id":"950c8ec1-db0e-11ef-9a4b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"袁宏漢紀：浮屠，佛也。西域天竺國有佛道焉。佛者，漢言覺也，將以覺悟羣生也。其敎以修善慈心爲主，不殺生，專務清靜。其精者爲沙門。沙門，漢言息也。蓋息意去欲以歸於無爲。長丈六尺，黃金色。初，明帝夢見金人長大，以問羣臣。或曰：「西方有神，其名曰佛，陛下所夢，得無是乎？」於是遣使天竺，問其道術而圖其形像焉。賢曰：伊蒲塞，卽優婆塞也，中國翻爲近住，言受戒行堪近僧住也。桑門，卽沙門，梵云沙門那，或曰桑門，唐言勤息，秦譯云勤行，又云善覺。魏收曰：漢武帝遣霍去病討匈奴，獲休屠王金人，以爲大神，列於甘泉宮，不祭祀，但燒香禮拜而已。此則佛道流通之漸也。張騫使大夏，傳其旁有身毒國，一名天竺，始聞有浮屠之敎。哀帝元壽元年，博士弟子秦景憲受大月氏王使伊存口授浮屠經，中國聞之，未信了也。後明帝夜夢金人，頂有白光，飛行殿庭，乃訪羣臣，傅毅始以佛對。帝遣郞中蔡愔等使天竺，寫浮屠遺範，仍與沙門攝摩騰、竺法蘭東還洛陽，中國有沙門跪拜之法自此始。愔之還，以白馬負經而至，漢因立白馬寺於洛城雍關西。好，呼到翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"袁宏汉纪：浮屠，佛也。西域天竺国有佛道焉。佛者，汉言觉也，将以觉悟群生也。其教以修善慈心为主，不杀生，专务清静。其精者为沙门。沙门，汉言息也。盖息意去欲以归于无为。长丈六尺，黄金色。初，明帝梦见金人长大，以问群臣。或曰：「西方有神，其名曰佛，陛下所梦，得无是乎？」于是遣使天竺，问其道术而图其形像焉。贤曰：伊蒲塞，即优婆塞也，中国翻为近住，言受戒行堪近僧住也。桑门，即沙门，梵云沙门那，或曰桑门，唐言勤息，秦译云勤行，又云善觉。魏收曰：汉武帝遣霍去病讨匈奴，获休屠王金人，以为大神，列于甘泉宫，不祭祀，但烧香礼拜而已。此则佛道流通之渐也。张骞使大夏，传其旁有身毒国，一名天竺，始闻有浮屠之教。哀帝元寿元年，博士弟子秦景宪受大月氏王使伊存口授浮屠经，中国闻之，未信了也。后明帝夜梦金人，顶有白光，飞行殿庭，乃访群臣，傅毅始以佛对。帝遣郞中蔡愔等使天竺，写浮屠遗范，仍与沙门摄摩腾、竺法兰东还洛阳，中国有沙门跪拜之法自此始。愔之还，以白马负经而至，汉因立白马寺于洛城雍关西。好，呼到翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":144,"tongjian_id":"950c8e9c-db0e-11ef-83bb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":71,"link_td_description":"刘英，东汉楚王，为光武帝和许美人所生，是已知中国贵族中最早的佛教信徒。","link_td_id":"Q10002430","link_td_number_id":356836,"people_name":"楚王","people_name_jianti_auto":"楚王","people_xingming":"刘英","start_index":136,"tongjian_id":"950ec50c-db0e-11ef-9965-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":71,"link_td_description":"刘英，东汉楚王，为光武帝和许美人所生，是已知中国贵族中最早的佛教信徒。","link_td_id":"Q10002430","link_td_number_id":356836,"people_name":"英","people_name_jianti_auto":"英","people_xingming":"刘英","start_index":138,"tongjian_id":"950ec50d-db0e-11ef-ac6c-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘庄弟]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"西域","place_name_jianti_auto":"西域","resolved_place_entity_id":259,"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"950ec50e-db0e-11ef-9fca-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"天竺","place_name_jianti_auto":"天竺","resolved_place_entity_id":1725,"start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"950ec50f-db0e-11ef-b4da-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"初，帝聞西域有神，其名曰佛，因遣使之天竺求其道，得其書及沙門以來。其書大抵以虛無爲宗，貴慈悲不殺；以爲人死，精神不滅，隨復受形；生時所行善惡，皆有報應，故所貴修煉精神，以至爲佛。善爲宏闊勝大之言，以勸誘愚俗。精於其道者，號曰沙門。於是中國始傳其術，圖其形像，而王公貴人，獨楚王英最先好之。","content_fanyi":"当初，汉明帝听说西域有神，名叫佛，于是派遣使者前往天竺国访求佛道，带回了佛经和僧人。佛经大致以虚无为宗旨，崇尚慈悲、不杀生；认为人死后灵魂不会消灭，会再投胎转世，重新受生为人形；生前所做的善恶之事，都会有报应，所以推重修炼精神心行，直至成佛。佛经善于讲说宏大高深的言辞，来劝导诱导愚昧的俗人。精通这一道法的人，称为沙门。从此中国开始传播佛教的教法，描画佛的图像，而王公贵人中，只有楚王刘英最先喜好佛教。","content_jianti_auto":"初，帝闻西域有神，其名曰佛，因遣使之天竺求其道，得其书及沙门以来。其书大抵以虚无为宗，贵慈悲不杀；以为人死，精神不灭，随复受形；生时所行善恶，皆有报应，故所贵修炼精神，以至为佛。善为宏阔胜大之言，以劝诱愚俗。精于其道者，号曰沙门。于是中国始传其术，图其形像，而王公贵人，独楚王英最先好之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，而以反自杀；笮融课民盛饰以事浮屠，而以劫掠死于锋刃；梁...","context_before":"","source_end_index":7,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"70b3d447-98e1-4117-9031-029b4f31086e","source_start_index":0,"source_text":"楚王英始事浮屠"}],"title":"五 事浮屠致祸"}],"id":3571,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"950c8e9b-db0e-11ef-8619-a0d3651f611f","zhang_TJZJ_id":"zttjzj_000698"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"旣，盡也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"既，尽也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"950ec511-db0e-11ef-8403-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"人主能切己省察，然後能有是言。","note_content_jianti_auto":"人主能切己省察，然后能有是言。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":126,"tongjian_id":"950ec514-db0e-11ef-9d6a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"7壬寅晦，日有食之，旣。詔羣司勉脩職事，極言無諱。於是在位者皆上封事，各言得失；帝覽章，深自引咎，以所上班示百官。詔曰：「羣僚所言，皆朕之過。民冤不能理，吏黠不能禁；而輕用民力，繕脩宮宇，出入無節，喜怒過差。永覽前戒，竦然兢懼；徒恐薄德，久而致怠耳！」","content_fanyi":"十月三十日壬寅晦，发生日食，是日全食。日食结束后，汉明帝下诏，命令百官努力尽好本职事务，直率进言不要有所忌讳。于是在位的官员都呈上密封奏章，各自陈述朝政得失；汉明帝阅览奏章后，深自引咎，主动承担过失，并把所上奏章交给百官传阅。又下诏说：“群臣所说的事情，都是朕的过失。百姓的冤屈不能得到审理，官吏的奸诈不能加以禁止；反而轻易役使民力，修建宫殿，挥霍国库、增收赋税而没有节制，喜怒失去常度。朕时常阅读前代的训诫，深感惶恐戒惧；只是担心自己德行浅薄，日久就会导致懈怠啊。”","content_jianti_auto":"7壬寅晦，日有食之，既。诏群司勉修职事，极言无讳。于是在位者皆上封事，各言得失；帝览章，深自引咎，以所上班示百官。诏曰：「群僚所言，皆朕之过。民冤不能理，吏黠不能禁；而轻用民力，缮修宫宇，出入无节，喜怒过差。永览前戒，竦然兢惧；徒恐薄德，久而致怠耳！」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3572,"number":7,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"950ec510-db0e-11ef-853e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"950ec519-db0e-11ef-8886-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"武帝","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"950ec51a-db0e-11ef-848f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"西域","place_name_jianti_auto":"西域","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"950ec51b-db0e-11ef-9696-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"950ec51c-db0e-11ef-a429-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：武帝開通西域，本三十六國，余謂堅其心者，欲使之專附匈奴。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：武帝开通西域，本三十六国，余谓坚其心者，欲使之专附匈奴。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"950ec518-db0e-11ef-a5a6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"得謀，猶言得計。復，扶又翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"得谋，犹言得计。复，扶又翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":126,"tongjian_id":"950ec51e-db0e-11ef-9bc9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"950ec520-db0e-11ef-bb10-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"950ec521-db0e-11ef-8ff0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：駁議，謂勸單于歸漢。駁，北角翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：驳议，谓劝单于归汉。驳，北角翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":137,"tongjian_id":"950ec51f-db0e-11ef-bb99-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"南單于庭","place_name_jianti_auto":"南单于庭","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"950ec523-db0e-11ef-af5c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西河","place_name_jianti_auto":"西河","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"950ec524-db0e-11ef-9879-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"美稷","place_name_jianti_auto":"美稷","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"950ec525-db0e-11ef-af6b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"烏桓","place_name_jianti_auto":"乌桓","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"950ec526-db0e-11ef-a2b7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"950ec527-db0e-11ef-9888-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"950ec528-db0e-11ef-93a6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"950ec529-db0e-11ef-8549-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"950ec52a-db0e-11ef-8b0c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"950ec52b-db0e-11ef-bc2c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"南單于庭在西河美稷。動搖，謂欲出塞北去。烏桓本附匈奴，漢置校尉領護，使不得與匈奴交通。離心，謂其心不親附漢而貳於匈奴也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"南单于庭在西河美稷。动摇，谓欲出塞北去。乌桓本附匈奴，汉置校尉领护，使不得与匈奴交通。离心，谓其心不亲附汉而贰于匈奴也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":152,"tongjian_id":"950ec522-db0e-11ef-88d6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"爲，于僞翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"为，于伪翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":224,"tongjian_id":"950ec52c-db0e-11ef-b7f1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"前書·匈奴傳曰：自君王以下，皆食畜肉，衣其皮革，被旃裘。旃，與氈同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"前书·匈奴传曰：自君王以下，皆食畜肉，衣其皮革，被旃裘。旃，与毡同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":258,"tongjian_id":"950ec52e-db0e-11ef-afd4-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"衆","people_name_jianti_auto":"众","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"950ec531-db0e-11ef-b8f5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"950ec532-db0e-11ef-800d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"車師","place_name_jianti_auto":"车师","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"950ec533-db0e-11ef-b205-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"漢制：大將軍營五部，部校尉一人，比二千石；軍司馬一人，比千石；其不置校尉部，但軍司馬一人。帝召衆爲軍司馬，使與馬賡擊車師。","note_content_jianti_auto":"汉制：大将军营五部，部校尉一人，比二千石；军司马一人，比千石；其不置校尉部，但军司马一人。帝召众为军司马，使与马赓击车师。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":344,"tongjian_id":"950ec530-db0e-11ef-bd5b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"度遼之衆","official_note":"度遼之衆指度辽将军的部队，负责北方边境防御，此处用于威慑匈奴。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"今幸有度遼之衆揚威北垂","start_index":144,"tongjian_id":"5db11235-6296-4e86-a268-7c0f4b8a626f"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"司法监察","official_name":"廷尉","official_note":"廷尉是汉代中央司法长官，掌管刑狱，此处表示郑众被拘捕并交由廷尉处理。","official_rank":"九卿之一","source_snippet":"繫廷尉","start_index":294,"tongjian_id":"d848fa95-e605-46b8-bb9b-758b224e016a"},{"confidence":0.92,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"軍司馬","official_note":"军司马是汉代军队中的中级军官，负责辅助将军管理军务，此处表示郑众被重新任命为军司马。","official_rank":"中下级军官","source_snippet":"乃復召衆爲軍司馬","start_index":336,"tongjian_id":"cf30c417-0d77-4833-ad8f-c954c37907d9"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":83,"link_td_description":"郑众，字仲师，河南郡开封县（今河南省开封市）人。东汉时经学家，官至大司农，又称郑司农。","link_td_id":"Q10003423","link_td_number_id":1066574,"people_name":"鄭衆","people_name_jianti_auto":"郑众","people_xingming":"郑众","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"950ec535-db0e-11ef-8331-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"北單于","people_name_jianti_auto":"北单于","people_xingming":"北匈奴单于","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"950ec536-db0e-11ef-a51d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"南單于","people_name_jianti_auto":"南单于","people_xingming":"南匈奴单于","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"950ec538-db0e-11ef-82a5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"南單于","people_name_jianti_auto":"南单于","start_index":152,"tongjian_id":"950ec53e-db0e-11ef-8a03-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":83,"link_td_description":"郑众，字仲师，河南郡开封县（今河南省开